usage: c26_campaign.py [-h] [--data-dir DATA_DIR] [--results-dir RESULTS_DIR]
                       [--binary BINARY] [--split {CAL,TEST}]
                       {prepare,train,cal,test,analyze,validate,audit-model,audit-all}

Frozen C26 actual-game campaign and independently implemented Python oracle.
The native decision process receives only legal histories, public seeds,
budget, and the TRAIN-fitted model. Exact evaluation labels live in a separate
artifact. Python memoization accelerates offline recurrence evaluation:
returned node counts sum every full-tree occurrence, including duplicate
boards and terminal entries. The native solver itself performs every charged
traversal without memoization.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,train,cal,test,analyze,validate,audit-model,audit-all}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-dir DATA_DIR
  --results-dir RESULTS_DIR
  --binary BINARY
  --split {CAL,TEST}
